From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Darrel=20Gri=C3=ABt?= <dgriet@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 21:55:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Input: atmel_u144: Mark the touchscreen as a direct input
 device
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The driver sets neither BTN_TOUCH nor INPUT_PROP_DIRECT.
udev needs one of them to tag the device with ID_INPUT_TOUCHSCREEN.
Without this tag Qt doesn't detect the touchscreen automatically.

Set INPUT_PROP_DIRECT to fix touchscreen detection.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [vendor driver]
Signed-off-by: Darrel Griët <dgriet@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/input/touchscreen/atmel_u144.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/input/touchscreen/atmel_u144.c b/drivers/input/touchscreen/atmel_u144.c
index 12444f7dab2e..90a09b563fa4 100644
--- a/drivers/input/touchscreen/atmel_u144.c
+++ b/drivers/input/touchscreen/atmel_u144.c
@@ -3069,6 +3069,7 @@ int mxt_initialize_t100_input_device(struct mxt_data *data)
 	__set_bit(EV_SYN, input_dev->evbit);
 	__set_bit(EV_KEY, input_dev->evbit);
 	__set_bit(KEY_SLEEP, input_dev->keybit);
+	__set_bit(INPUT_PROP_DIRECT, input_dev->propbit);
 
 	/* For multi touch */
 	input_mt_init_slots(input_dev, data->pdata->numtouch, 0);
